Step 3: Wave 0 agents (00a/00b/00c/00d) + runWave0 orchestration

src/lib/agents/shared/
- invoke.ts: generic agent invocation harness with prompt-cache, JSON
  extraction (handles prose-wrapped responses), Zod validation,
  AgentInvocationError on parse/schema failures
- schemas.ts: Zod runtime schemas for all 4 Wave 0 agents matching the
  TS interfaces in src/types/agents.ts
- prompt-loader.ts: caches .md prompt files per-process

src/lib/agents/wave0/
- agent-00a-prompt.md + agent-00a.ts (Haiku, max_tokens 350)
  Timeframe detector. Reads NinjaTrader header / EMA legend / TOS Mobile
  header. Bar-density inference fallback capped at confidence 70. Abstain
  on NON_TIME_BARS / OTHER / unreadable.

- agent-00b-prompt.md + agent-00b.ts (Opus, max_tokens 600)
  Chart state classifier. 9 states with eligible verdict-mode mappings.
  state_at_right_edge field for cycling charts.

- agent-00c-prompt.md + agent-00c.ts (Opus, max_tokens 500)
  Setup variant classifier. VARIANT_A is V1 happy path; B/C/D/OTHER
  route to SKIP_OUT_OF_SCOPE per architecture/01-pattern-taxonomy.md.
  ABSTAIN_INPUT for unreadable charts.

- agent-00d-prompt.md + agent-00d.ts (Sonnet, max_tokens 500)
  Anticipation/wait-level. Cloud-as-level priority hierarchy. Time
  window heuristic with 1.5-2x pessimism multiplier. Hard ATR distance
  cap. Mandatory invalidation_price. Score < 55 abstains to SKIP.

- index.ts: runWave0() orchestration
  Pipeline: 00a -> if abstain bail (no Opus calls). Else 00b+00c
  parallel. 00c=non-A -> out_of_scope (skip 00d). State actionable
  (REJECTION_FIRING / PULLBACK_IN_PROGRESS) -> actionable_now (skip 00d).
  State worth watching -> 00d -> wait_for_level or skip_no_edge based
  on 00d score. RANGE_BOUND/INSUFFICIENT_HISTORY -> skip_no_edge direct.

Tests:
- 16 invoke harness tests (extractJson edge cases, mock SDK, error paths)
- 7 agent-00a tests (timeframe enum, source enum, Haiku tier, max_tokens)
- 8 agent-00b tests (all 9 states, recommended_verdict_modes validation)
- 7 agent-00c tests (V1 vs V2 variants, ABSTAIN_INPUT, secondary_variants)
- 8 agent-00d tests (window enum, layer enum, abstain, all directions)
- 17 runWave0 orchestration tests (5 routing categories, cost discipline,
  parallel 00b+00c, downstream agent skipping)

121/121 vitest pass total. 134/134 pytest pass (no Python changes).
TypeScript type-check clean. Python audit clean.

All Wave 0 prompts use Anthropic prompt caching on the system prompt
per Wave E spec section 13. Real API calls deferred until user provides
real ANTHROPIC_API_KEY (currently placeholder per autonomous build auth).
